cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research or engineering designs, please cite it as below."
title: "EMA-C_LM-Cryo-Modelling: Non-Linear Lumped-Parameter Thermal Network and Thermo-Mechanical Co-Design for the EMA Beamline Nanostation at Sirius/LNLS"
abstract: "A modular, non-linear cryogenic thermal modeling framework in Julia featuring NIST material properties with exact Kirchhoff transformation, contact resistance models with Indium foil plastic yield, Helium exchange gas gap (Sherman-Lees), and thermo-mechanical co-design optimization for high-pressure diamond anvil cells (DAC) at synchrotron beamlines."
authors:
